prose={
'scope':('June 28, 2026 financial, capital and discount origin; information through October 18, 2026. This is a retrospective conditional scenario, not an as-known-at-origin backtest or a current stock valuation. Current-price comparison is blocked.','财务、资本及折现基准日为 2026 年 6 月 28 日，信息截至 2026 年 10 月 18 日。这是回溯条件性情景，不是基准日当时已知信息回测，也不是当前股价估值。当前价格比较已禁用。'),
'summary':('Lam Research: systems and support/other revenue are modeled separately. Base, cycle-and-export downside and process-intensity upside are complete analyst scenarios with no assigned probabilities. Customer support also includes upgrades and Reliant equipment, so it is not a guaranteed annuity.','拉姆研究：系统及支持／其他收入分别建模。基准、周期及出口下行、工艺强度上行均为完整分析情景，未赋予概率。客户支持还包括升级及 Reliant 设备，因此并非有保证的年金收入。'),
'growth':('Base FY2027 systems growth of 40% and support/other growth of 25% produce 31,273.686 million revenue, below September-quarter guidance annualized to 32,400 million. Later growth fades explicitly. The old 2028 strategic target is dated context, not a current ceiling. Three recent upcycle guidance observations do not establish long-run forecasting reliability.','基准 2027 财年系统增长 40%、支持／其他增长 25%，收入为 312.73686 亿美元，低于九月季度指引年化后的 324 亿美元。后续增长明确递减。旧的 2028 年战略目标属于历史背景，并非当前上限。近期上行周期三次指引观察不能证明长期预测可靠性。'),
'profitability':('Base economic margin starts at 38%, reaches 39% and fades to 32%. It already includes a 3% recurring future-grant compensation budget, an analyst assumption. Residual non-SBC costs include D&A and expensed R&D. Legacy expense is subtracted and reversed identically, creating no valuation uplift. Future grants are not diluted again.','基准经济营业利润率从 38% 起步，达到 39% 后递减至 32%，已包含占收入 3% 的持续未来授予薪酬预算；该预算属于分析假设。非股权薪酬残余成本包含折旧摊销及费用化研发。旧奖励费用等额扣除并转回，不提高估值。未来授予不再另计稀释。'),
'capital':('Initial sales/capital of 1.8× is an analyst assumption. The corrected FY2026 identified-investment diagnostic is 2.067412× after inventory-to-PPE transfers and finance-lease additions; the older five-year 1.818× core proxy is incomplete. Positive operating-investment floors remain explicit. The separate 119.605 million opening capex payable is paid once in FY2027, outside forward operating NWC and equity claims.','初期销售／资本比 1.8 倍属于分析假设。计入存货转固定资产及融资租赁新增后，2026 财年已识别投资诊断修正为 2.067412 倍；旧的五年 1.818 倍核心代理值并不完整。正向经营投资下限保持明确。另有 1.19605 亿美元期初资本开支应付款仅在 2027 财年支付一次，不计入未来经营营运资本或股权请求权。'),
'funding':('Year 1 total cash investment includes a fixed 119.605 million opening capex-payable settlement. Capital multipliers, annual investment uncertainty and horizon changes alter only operating investment; the settlement stays in year 1. Direct annual investment uncertainty samples the operating component and adds the fixed settlement once. A total below this fixed obligation is blocked.','第 1 年投资现金总额包含固定 1.19605 亿美元期初资本开支应付款结算。资本乘数、年度投资不确定性及期限变化仅调整经营投资；该结算保留在第 1 年。直接年度投资不确定性抽样经营部分，再加一次固定结算。低于该固定义务的投资总额会被阻止。'),
'wacc':('Initial WACC is 10.973327%, fading to 9.23991%. The 4.87% adjusted USD risk-free rate, 4.42% ERP and 1.39 industry beta have their own observation dates. Leverage, credit spread and mature beta are assumptions. October rates are applied to a June-origin retrospective scenario without fitting a stock quote.','初期 WACC 为 10.973327%，递减至 9.23991%。调整后的美元无风险利率 4.87%、股权风险溢价 4.42% 及行业贝塔 1.39 各有观察日期。杠杆、信用利差及成熟期贝塔属于假设。十月利率用于六月基准日回溯情景，未拟合市场股价。'),
'tax':('The near-term 15% operating tax assumption fades to 21%, rather than perpetuating FY2026 tax benefits. Opening booked tax claims of 944.402 million are deducted once and excluded from forward operating NWC. Gross uncertain tax benefits, booked claims and tax-interest disclosures overlap.','近期经营税率假设为 15%，逐步过渡至 21%，不将 2026 财年税收优惠永久化。期初已入账税款请求权 9.44402 亿美元仅扣除一次，并从未来经营营运资本中排除。未确认税收利益总额、已入账请求权及税款利息披露存在重叠。'),
'terminal':('Base terminal assumptions are 3% nominal growth, 32% economic margin, 21% tax, 18% next-period incremental ROIC and 9.23991% WACC. Terminal investment equals NOPAT × growth / ROIC. Mature sales/capital uses the same-period timing adjustment. Continuing compensation and capital funding remain included.','基准终值假设为 3% 名义增长、32% 经济利润率、21% 税率、18% 下一期增量 ROIC 及 9.23991% WACC。终值再投资＝NOPAT×增长率／ROIC。成熟期销售／资本比保留同期时间调整。持续薪酬及资本投入仍包含在内。'),
'claims':('June common shares of 1,251.278 million plus 7.454664 million maximum existing awards/options give 1,258.732664 million allocation units. Existing options are conservatively treated as zero-exercise units, not option fair value; no proceeds or second option claim are added. Current ESPP uses a 150 million analyst estimate; 70–300 million are stress values, not measured fair value or a proven loss bound.','六月普通股 12.51278 亿股加最高 745.4664 万现有奖励／期权，得到 12.58732664 亿分配单位。现有期权按零行权价单位保守处理，并非期权公允价值；不增加行权收入或第二份期权请求权。现有 ESPP 采用 1.5 亿美元分析估计；7,000 万至 3 亿美元只是压力值，并非已测公允价值或已证明损失上限。'),
'claimLimits':('The 34.348 million repurchase payable is real; zero incremental deduction assumes coverage within already-deducted or funded balances, with unresolved allocation. Residual claims, tax interest and repurchase stresses overlap: select at most one positive stress. The 300 million residual stress is not a coverage ceiling. Pension, litigation and some assets remain unmapped or unquantifiable. Deferred-compensation assets/liabilities are netted; only a 0–13.3 million net recovery is considered.','3,434.8 万美元回购应付款确实存在；额外扣除为零是假设已扣除或已融资余额覆盖它，具体归类尚未解决。残余请求权、税款利息及回购压力存在重叠：最多选一个正向压力值。3 亿美元残余压力并非覆盖上限。养老金、诉讼及部分资产尚未归类或无法量化。递延薪酬资产／负债净额处理，仅考虑 0–1,330 万美元净回收。'),
'uncertainty':('No probability calibration is supplied. All simulation inputs start fixed at the selected case; Run is manual. Named scenarios and claim stresses have no assigned probabilities. Unknown selected claim inputs block common allocation while valid operating value remains visible.','未提供概率校准。全部模拟输入从固定选定情景开始，须手动运行。命名情景及请求权压力测试均未赋予概率。选定请求权输入未知时，普通股分配会被阻止，但有效经营价值仍可显示。'),
'history':('The ten-year canonical history uses reported operating EBIT including separately presented restructuring charges, and explicitly normalized shares for the October 2024 ten-for-one split. Already-restated weighted shares are not split again. Core trade NWC and investment diagnostics remain partial; missing classifications are not reported zeros. Historical selected facts were reviewed, not every annual filing or complete conference audio.','十年规范历史采用已报告经营 EBIT，包含单独列示的重组费用，并明确按 2024 年 10 月一拆十规范股数。已重述加权股数不会再次拆股调整。核心贸易营运资本及投资诊断仍不完整；缺失分类不等于已报告零值。审核了选定历史事实，并非每份年报或完整会议音频。')}
